#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:7
msgid "Comparator"
msgstr "比較器"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:9
msgid ""
"`Problem` delegates deciding the relative superiority of solutions to "
"`Comparator`, a swappable top-level component. Pass it via `Problem`'s "
"`comparator` argument."
msgstr ""
"`Problem`は、解の優劣を判断する処理を`Comparator`という差し替え可能なトップレベルコンポーネントに委ねています。 "
"`Problem`の`comparator`引数で渡します。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:12
msgid "Comparator's role"
msgstr "Comparatorの役割"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:14
msgid ""
"`Comparator` has four methods that are all abstract, including `__init__`"
" itself."
msgstr "`Comparator`は、`__init__`自体を含めて4つのメソッド全てが抽象メソッドです。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:16
msgid ""
"**`__init__(weights, eps_cv, eps_obj, direction=None)`**: Holds "
"`weights`/`eps_cv`/`eps_obj`/`direction`"
msgstr ""
"**`__init__(weights, eps_cv, eps_obj, "
"direction=None)`**：`weights`/`eps_cv`/`eps_obj`/`direction`を保持します"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:17
msgid ""
"**`sort_population(population) -> np.ndarray`**: Returns an index array "
"ordering the entire population from best to worst"
msgstr "**`sort_population(population) -> np.ndarray`**：個体群全体を優劣順に並べたインデックス配列を返します"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:18
msgid ""
"**`compare_population(population, idx_a, idx_b) -> int`**: Compares two "
"individuals within a population (`-1`: a is better, `1`: b is better, "
"`0`: equal)"
msgstr ""
"**`compare_population(population, idx_a, idx_b) -> "
"int`**：個体群中の2個体を比較します（`-1`：aが優れる、`1`：bが優れる、`0`：同等）"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:19
msgid ""
"**`compare(fa, cv_a, fb, cv_b) -> int`**: A lightweight version that "
"compares two points directly from their objective values and constraint "
"violation, without going through `Population`"
msgstr ""
"**`compare(fa, cv_a, fb, cv_b) -> "
"int`**：`Population`を介さず、目的関数値と制約違反から直接2点を比較する軽量版"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:21
msgid ""
"Having `__init__` be an abstract method is different from other "
"components. Subclasses implementing a custom `Comparator` must always "
"call `super().__init__(weights, eps_cv, eps_obj, direction=...)`."
msgstr ""
"`__init__`が抽象メソッドである点は他のコンポーネントと異なります。 "
"独自の`Comparator`を実装するサブクラスは、必ず`super().__init__(weights, eps_cv, eps_obj, "
"direction=...)`を呼ばなければなりません。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/comparators.md:24
msgid "Built-in Comparators"
msgstr "組み込みComparator"

